# City goal "Faster Than the F" (kind speed in a box): down Market St from the spot, push and tuck:
# 44 km/h by the bottom, past 40 on the way.
park sf
spawn market_st
cmd 0 traffic clear
hold up 10..200
hold ollie 200..1800
run 1800
expect event goalComplete{id=market40,area=Market} within 1000..1500
